					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="immersive-reel section--rose fade-up">
					<div class="section-head">
						<p class="section-kicker">Visual Atmosphere</p>
						<h2 class="heading-accent">Color, Motion, Mood</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="reel-grid">
						<article class="reel-card">
							<video
								src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dg4xwrzu9/video/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_900,c_fill,vc_auto/v1771784294/grok-video-a77ba723-ed82-47fb-a44c-da394706ef53_zsw8ku.mp4"
								autoplay
								muted
								loop
								playsinline
								preload="metadata"
							></video>
							<div class="reel-copy">
								<h3>Editorial Energy</h3>
								<p>Film-led direction designed for elegant movement and premium visual tone.</p>
							</div>
						</article>
						<article class="reel-card">
							<div class="art-frame">
								<img src={SITE_MEDIA.two} alt="Cinematic portrait detail" loading="lazy" />
							</div>
							<div class="reel-copy">
								<h3>Luxury Detail</h3>
								<p>Styling, texture, and light shaping that keeps every frame polished and intentional.</p>
							</div>
						</article>
						<article class="reel-card">
							<video
								src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dg4xwrzu9/video/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_900,c_fill,vc_auto/v1771789682/grok-video-615b8d45-bf96-464e-a1ec-9af35c32e448_1_zc25xe.mp4"
								autoplay
								muted
								loop
								playsinline
								preload="metadata"
							></video>
							<div class="reel-copy">
								<h3>Cinematic Finish</h3>
								<p>Refined edits and grading that keep sessions timeless, not trend-driven.</p>
							</div>
						</article>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="identity-statement section--dark fade-up">
					<div class="section-head">
						<p class="section-kicker">Art Direction</p>
						<h2 class="heading-accent">Intimate. Cinematic. Elevated.</h2>
					</div>
					<p>
						We create boudoir, artistic nude, body-paint, and creator-focused visual work with a luxury editorial finish.
						Every set is designed for atmosphere, confidence, and intention.
					</p>
					<div class="identity-moodboard">
						<div class="art-frame"><img src={SITE_MEDIA.three} alt="Moody studio silhouette" loading="lazy" /></div>
						<div class="art-frame"><img src={SITE_MEDIA.four} alt="Body paint editorial detail" loading="lazy" /></div>
						<div class="art-frame"><img src={SITE_MEDIA.about} alt="Cinematic close-up portrait" loading="lazy" /></div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="privacy-block section--dark fade-up">
					<div class="section-head">
						<p class="section-kicker">Privacy + Discretion</p>
						<h2 class="heading-accent">Confidential By Design</h2>
					</div>
					<p>
						Every session includes consent-first planning, private production flow, and controlled release options. You decide
						what is shared, where it appears, and how final files are delivered.
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Private consultation and clear boundaries before production</li>
						<li>Professional direction centered on comfort and consent</li>
						<li>Secure delivery and publication control</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="process-block section--rose fade-up">
					<div class="section-head">
						<p class="section-kicker">How It Works</p>
						<h2 class="heading-accent">Consultation To Delivery</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="process-grid">
						<article>
							<p class="step">01</p>
							<h3>Consultation</h3>
							<p>We define mood, boundaries, intent, and desired outcomes.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<p class="step">02</p>
							<h3>Creative Planning</h3>
							<p>Wardrobe, references, location, and schedule are mapped in detail.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<p class="step">03</p>
							<h3>Session Direction</h3>
							<p>Calm, guided production with editorial posing and premium lighting.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<p class="step">04</p>
							<h3>Retouch + Delivery</h3>
							<p>Curated finals delivered discreetly with clear publishing permissions.</p>
						</article>
					</div>
					<div class="process-visual art-frame">
						<img src={SITE_MEDIA.about} alt="Private studio session planning mood board" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="signature-moment fade-up">
					<video
						src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dg4xwrzu9/video/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1400,c_fill,vc_auto/v1771783064/grok-video-9235aa62-6fdd-4f45-bd14-ebb3fd08ae08_vrrjjo.mp4"
						autoplay
						muted
						loop
						playsinline
						preload="metadata"
					></video>
					<div class="signature-overlay"></div>
					<div class="signature-copy">
						<p class="section-kicker">Signature Moment</p>
						<h2 class="heading-accent">A Session That Feels Like Cinema</h2>
						<p>
							Soft direction, intentional movement, and refined color design that turns confidence into timeless visual work.
						</p>
						<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/booking" data-track data-track-element="home_begin_session">Begin Your Session</a>
