						</article>
						<article>
							<h3>Creative Direction</h3>
							<p>Posing, styling, and narrative guidance built for artistic storytelling and platform-ready edits.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<h3>Content Ownership</h3>
							<p>Clear usage agreements and publishing control so you decide what is shared and where.</p>
						</article>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="testimonials-block section--dark fade-up">
					<div class="section-head">
						<p class="section-kicker">Client Feedback</p>
						<h2 class="heading-accent">Trusted Experience</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="testimonials-grid">
						<article>
							<p>
								"They made the entire process feel calm and professional. The final set was tasteful, confident, and exactly
								what we envisioned."
							</p>
							<h3>Private Client</h3>
						</article>
						<article>
							<p>
								"Direction was clear and respectful from start to finish. The delivery process was secure and easy, and the
								imagery looked editorial."
							</p>
							<h3>Destination Session Client</h3>
						</article>
